              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cjh22"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Coconut margaritas are my new favorite drink!!!! I added the lime mixture as well, really need that hint of sour! There is a reason they wrote the song \"put the lime in the coconut....make it feel better!\" Also served it on the rocks, not blended!!! Excellent !"
          },
