            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LAKYNI"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is an excellent drink. I did add 1 1/2 oz. of lime juice, so I don't know how it tastes without it...but I highly recommend adding it. Also served on the rocks from a pitcher rather than blending.",
            "datePublished": "2010-07-19T12:14:26.217Z"
